  "notes": "更准确的订阅能力协商。\n\n- 订阅保留 Clash 兼容身份，并附带真实应用版本，让悦通服务为支持的客户端启用 Gecko 混淆；旧版和未知版本继续兼容 Salamander。\n- 修复更新后可能沿用旧订阅缓存的问题：缓存验证现在同时检查订阅地址和客户端能力身份，下载失败仍保留可用配置。\n- 名称探测、代理下载、直连回退共用同一协商方式，并验证 Gecko 与 Salamander 的真实连接和数据传输。\n\n本版不修改第三方订阅地址或强制改写其混淆配置。网络效果取决于设备与线路，Gecko 不代表永久免受干扰或固定提速。\n",
  "notesEn": "Accurate subscription capability negotiation.\n\n- Retain the Clash-compatible identity and include the actual app version so YueTong can select Gecko for supported clients, while older and unknown versions remain compatible with Salamander.\n- Scope cached subscription validators to both the URL and client identity. Upgrades refresh outdated representations without deleting working configurations if a download fails.\n- Use the same identity for subscription previews, proxied downloads and direct fallback, with real connection and data-transfer tests for both obfuscation modes.\n\nThird-party subscription URLs and their obfuscation choices are not rewritten. Results depend on the device and route; Gecko does not guarantee permanent resistance to interference or a fixed speed increase.\n",
